@b = http://localhost:8143

### through the generated client
GET {{b}}/shop/products/1

### query params
GET {{b}}/shop/products?q=book&limit=1

### POST with body + Idempotency-Key header (set by the controller)
POST {{b}}/shop/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Pen", "price": 20}

### headers added by the group config
GET {{b}}/shop/echo

### upstream 404 mapped to a problem
GET {{b}}/shop/products/99

### read timeout -> 504
GET {{b}}/shop/slow?ms=2000
